:: Mint Mocha - Low Love Farm Confession
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
You're mucking out a stall when you hear the fence gate click, and there <<he>> is — Mint Mocha, arms crossed, glaring at the ground like it did something to <<him>>.
<br><br>
"I've been helping out for a while now," <<he>> says, before you can even say hello. "Don't act surprised."
<br><br>
You weren't going to. But you let <<him>> have the moment anyway.
<br><br>
